WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.118
In tutorial 7.8, you'll see what Google's
and AI assistants' crawlers fetch on your

00:00:11.168 --> 00:00:13.356
site, from your website's logs.

00:00:14.397 --> 00:00:16.347
First, open Crawlers.

00:00:16.397 --> 00:00:20.797
Crawlers are the programs that search
engines and AI assistants send to read your

00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:21.718
pages.

00:00:22.666 --> 00:00:25.691
Click Upload a log, choose
your server's log file,

00:00:25.741 --> 00:00:28.687
the record of every visit
it keeps, and click Upload.

00:00:30.716 --> 00:00:33.716
Or let your hosting send
its logs on its own.

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:37.566
Send logs automatically has a
guide for Cloudflare Logpush,

00:00:37.616 --> 00:00:39.871
or your hosting's own log export.

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:42.855
The guide walks you through each step,

00:00:42.905 --> 00:00:45.704
and you can copy the steps
or send them to a colleague.

00:00:47.855 --> 00:00:51.905
Then the top counts the requests
from Googlebot and from AI crawlers,

00:00:51.955 --> 00:00:56.822
the pages fetched because a person asked
an AI assistant, and fake crawlers.

00:00:57.834 --> 00:01:01.209
Every crawler lists each one
by name, with its requests,

00:01:01.259 --> 00:01:03.195
and whether it was proved to be real.

00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:10.401
Next, Pages Googlebot did not fetch and
Pages no AI crawler read show the pages with

00:01:10.401 --> 00:01:12.926
search traffic that crawlers skipped.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:18.645
Crawl budget Googlebot spent badly
lists requests wasted on redirects,

00:01:18.695 --> 00:01:23.932
addresses that send visitors elsewhere,
on errors, and on extra page versions.

00:01:24.891 --> 00:01:29.341
Beside it, you see the pages AI assistants
fetched because someone asked them a

00:01:29.391 --> 00:01:30.192
question.

00:01:31.441 --> 00:01:36.066
New pages, first seen lists pages
Googlebot found for the first time.

00:01:36.116 --> 00:01:41.129
Fetched by Google, missing from your
page list shows old or unlinked pages.

00:01:42.169 --> 00:01:46.964
Finally, Impostors lists requests that used
a crawler's name but came from somewhere

00:01:46.989 --> 00:01:49.638
else. They're left out of every figure.

00:01:50.623 --> 00:01:55.673
So you know which pages search engines and
AI assistants read, which ones they miss,

00:01:55.723 --> 00:01:57.371
and who's only pretending.

00:01:58.370 --> 00:02:02.840
So, upload a log or send logs
automatically, read who fetched what,

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:07.062
find missed pages and wasted
requests, and spot impostors.

00:02:08.046 --> 00:02:13.751
You know your crawlers. Next, choose what
is checked every week, in tutorial 7.9.
